    {
      "text": "VI. DISCUSSION",
      "bbox": [
        399.46099853515625,
        370.93133544921875,
        471.74774169921875,
        379.837890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In this work, we outlined a controller capable of enabling",
      "bbox": [
        323.1629943847656,
        386.2843322753906,
        558.0013427734375,
        395.1908874511719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "agile ﬁxed-wing ﬂight in unknown environments. In sim-",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        398.23931884765625,
        558.0009155273438,
        407.1458740234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ulation, we showed the ability to navigate a tight hallway",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        410.1943054199219,
        558.0008544921875,
        419.1008605957031
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "environment with a ﬁxed-wing UAV. We also demonstrated",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        422.1492919921875,
        558.0010375976562,
        431.05584716796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the ability of a ﬁxed-wing to avoid and navigate around",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        434.10528564453125,
        558.0009155273438,
        443.0118408203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "a building without prior knowledge of its environment. In",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        446.0602722167969,
        558.0009155273438,
        454.9668273925781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the future, we plan to explore improving system robust-",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        458.0152587890625,
        558.0008544921875,
        466.92181396484375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ness by more tightly coupling perception and control. For",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        469.9702453613281,
        558.0009155273438,
        478.8768005371094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "instance, by augmenting the optimizer’s cost function, we",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        481.92523193359375,
        558.0008544921875,
        490.831787109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "may be able to reduce failure cases by rewarding information",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        493.8812255859375,
        558.0010986328125,
        502.78778076171875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "gathering during aggressive maneuvers. We may also be",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        505.836181640625,
        558.0009155273438,
        514.7427368164062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "able to improve performance by using generative adversarial",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        517.7911987304688,
        558.0009765625,
        526.69775390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "networks, as was done in [30], to predict and reason about",
      "bbox": [
        313.1999816894531,
        529.7462158203125,
        558.0010375976562,
        538.6527709960938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
